<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss revised Nov trade surplus Sfr 804.3 million.</title>
<headline>Swiss revised Nov trade surplus Sfr 804.3 million.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland revised its November trade surplus up to 804.3 million Swiss francs from an originally reported 781.7 million, the Federal Customs Office said on Monday.</p>
<p> SWISS TRADE		  Nov 96		Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p> Balance (million Sfr)  +804.3  (+781.7)   +226.8    +603.2</p>
<p> Exports		   8,497.5 (8,471.2)  8,690.0   8,468.9</p>
<p> Imports		   7,693.2 (7,689.5)  8,463.2   7,865.7</p>
<p>Note - preliminary November figures in brackets. All figures excluded precious metals, precious stones, art objects and antiques. -- Zurich Newsroom +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
